window.products.push({"id":198044,"name":"Twin Mattress, 6 Inch Memory Foam Mattress Bed in a Box, Medium, Green Tea and Cooling Gel Infused CertiPUR-US Certified, Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":130.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X+VLblJqL._AC_.jpg","description":"All Foam Mattress for Ultimate Sleep Experience - Pressure relief is somewhat the most important aspect when it comes to high-quality rest. If you wake up feeling painful spots in your body, that’s probably because your bed is just not suitable for you. The twin memory foam mattresses feature a high-density supportive core for superior pressure-relieving support, manage to distribute weight evenly, and ensure that there’s no pressure on the shoulders and hips which are the most problematic areas. Green Tea Gel Mattress Improved Overall Sleep - The 6-inch twin mattress with a green tea gel-infused memory foam layer helps with temperature regulation throughout the night. It's topped with a breathable fabric cover that's designed to help you sleep cool and provide extra breathability. This 6-inch memory foam mattress is designed to fight odor, wick away moisture, and provide a refreshing, more supportive sleep for you and your family. CertiPUR-US Certified Mattress for Safety - All of our mattresses meet the highest quality and comfort standards and are made of 100% CertiPUR-US certified foams. Fiberglass-Free FR inner cover and graphene technology cover provides a safe, effective flame retardant layer around our mattresses. Therefore, You can rest easy knowing the twin-size mattress is free of ozone-depleting substances like formaldehyde and toxic metals. Medium Firm Mattress for Most Types of Sleeper - Sleeping on a mattress that is either too firm or too soft may cause body strain. This foam mattress is 7 out of 10 on the firmness level scale, which is tailored to adapt to most body types and sleep styles. The medium-firm feel mattress uses an even mix of comfort and support to relieve pain-causing pressure points and support healthy sleeping positions. Twin Mattress in a Box & 10-Year Warranty - Our technology allows this mattress to be efficiently compressed into one box that’s easily shipped and maneuvered into the bedroom; simply unbox, unroll and this mattress does the rest, expanding to its original shape within 24 hours. MLILY is a professional manufacturer of mattresses, with 2 factories in the United States, located in Arizona and South Carolina, so you don't worry about the quality of the mattress. For 10 years after you purchase your new mattress from MLILY when it has a defect covered under the warranty, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X+VLblJqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MLILY","source_asin":"B09SHSC9DR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SHSC9DR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SHSC9DR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
