window.products.push({"id":198062,"name":"Mulberry Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin 2 Pack, 25 Momme Slip Pllow Cases, Real Grade 6A Both Side Pure Luxury Smooth with Hidden Zipper(Grey, Stan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UJVYv0-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM SILK MATERIAL: Our silk pillowcases are made from 100% 25 momme highest grade 6A superior mulberry silk and double sided design. Compare with some 21, 22 Momme silk pillowcases,while 25Momme is top-of-the-line, which more density of the silk mean extra durability, making for a more luxurious experience.The silk are longer and more uniform, so the fabric is smoother and stronger will hold up through more washes. ELEVATE BEAUTY SLEEP: Spoil yourself with true beauty sleep. Our pure mulberry silk pillow case will transform your overnight rest into an 8-hour beauty treatment, making your skin and hair softer and healthier so away from friction damage. Turns out all that friction can cause creases that turn into wrinkles over time, but silk pillowcases create a smooth surface for your skin to glide over-with less friction there will be less creases on your skin. REDUCE “BED HEAD” AND KEEP HAIR SHINY: 25 momme pure silk pillowcase is your hair’s damage controler and frizz rescuer. Smooth silk allows your hair to gently glide across your pillow while you sleep, reducing split ends and hair breakage. By protecting your hair from friction damage, you can minimize your morning hairstyling routine because you will wake up tangle-free and frizz-free. Every morning, your hair and skin no longer feels dry or dehydrated. NATURE HEAT REGULATORS: Mulberry silk pillowcase keeps you cool in summer and warm in winter. Silk is a breathable fabric, tend to be good heat regulators, which means no flipping your pillow over to the cold side every 20 minutes. Whatever season, you can keep a suitable temperature for sleep. LUXURIOUS GIFTS: This silk pillowcase is definitely the most practical gift for your curly haired friends and those who want a comfortable sleep. We recommend buying 2 or more, not only for backup use when you washed the another one, but also for a travel must! Any quality issues, please feel free to contact us. Your satisfaction is our top priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UJVYv0-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyde Lane","source_asin":"B07WJJ3DXH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WJJ3DXH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WJJ3DXH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
