window.products.push({"id":198074,"name":"Toptier Butter Dish with Lid, Cute Bear Butter Dish, Porcelain Butter Keeper, Butter Holder with Handle Cover, Butter Container Perfect for East & Wes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RlBfibGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Measuring Lines & Triple Non-slip Design - The bear butter dish has cutting measurement for both east coast and west coast butter sticks to help you portion sizes accurately. The cute X design handle of this funny gift allows you easy to pick up or move around. There are anti-slip silicone particles on the bottom, which can prevent the butter from slipping. Large Capacity - This cute butter holder is 7.7” long and 4.75” wide, and the 4.2\" tall lid has enough capacity to easily accommodate a full \"American size\" stick of butter, including east/west coast butter; without worrying about the butter hitting the top or sides of the lid. A properly sized butter container can be conveniently placed in the refrigerator or counter space. Professional Grade Porcelain - The butter dish is made of durable lead-free, eco-friendly professional-grade porcelain for enhanced product stability. The thick walls of the butter dish keep the butter from getting too hard in the refrigerator and stay soft at room temperature. Even more surprising is that this butter dish made of high-quality material can be used safely in the oven, induction cooktop, and dishwasher. Great Addition to Your Kitchen - The cute bear shape butter dish with black, blue-green, and white color indeed adds a certain novelty and uniqueness to your table setting. And you will smile every time you see this cute butter dish on the counter. Wonderful Gift - With its bear shape and cute design, this butter dish with lid is perfect for use in kitchens, counters, restaurants, and more, making it the ideal home for butter sticks, convenient for you to use fresh butter anytime, anywhere. At the same time, it's an ideal gift for yourself, family, and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RlBfibGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"toptier","source_asin":"B0B62RSWJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B62RSWJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B62RSWJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
