window.products.push({"id":198170,"name":"Global Crafts 24\" Recycled Handmade Haitian Metal Wall Art Sea Life, Leaping Fish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ERtBC-WCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made by Fair Trade Artisans in Haiti; hand-painted design, color may vary; due to the handmade nature of each piece, the size may vary by up to 2 inches. Suitable for indoor or outdoor use Made of recycled steel, this sculpture will rust over time if it is exposed to the elements. If you do not prefer the look of a weathered patina, you can maintain the original look by applying a spray-on clear enamel once a year. Socially responsible product assortment empowers consumers to purchase according to their values and help alleviate poverty. Fair Trade product. Fair Trade is so much more than a product assortment. It's about safe workplaces, fair wages and community investment for factory employees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ERtBC-WCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global Crafts","source_asin":"B07R5B3SJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R5B3SJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R5B3SJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":198171,"name":"AUJOY Stretch 2-Piece Chair Covers Water-Repellent Dog Cat Pet Proof Couch Slipcovers Protectors (Chair, Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qYcZAv0nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to protect my armchair by this chair cover? Unique Water Repellent fabric make 100% protection from wet stains, spills and any accidents, especially for kids and pets. When the liquid inadvertently has been spilled on the cover, just take it easy, the dew drops will be formed on the surface of our sofa cover in a short time so that it will not penetrate on your sofa. Then wipe it off by dry towel, while don’t leave the dew drops on the cover too long, if it will be leaking more or less. In addition, our cover is Pet friendly, we have taken use of the full-coverage cover for you, it will be a perfect protect from pet's hair, footprints and various stains.Great for those who are seeking the shields for furniture.Or if your chair is too old, don’t need to buy a new one , just take our cover , it can freshen your chair up and give you a different visual effect. What size sofa cover should I choose ? In order to satisfied the needs of different sofa, we have many sizes to be selected in our store. Firstly you should find a measuring tape to measure your back of sofa size (we have provide the measuring guide in the listing photo in detail) and then to choose the suitable size for your furniture. Chair(31’’-46’’) Love seat (55’’-69’’) Sofa (71’’-91”) XL Sofa (91’’-110”） How can it be a good fit with my armchair? Because of the design of the high stretch, which make it is applicable to most armchair couches.However, before purchasing you must read our installation guide that we have mentioned in the listing picture. You should read it clearly and then install it as our guide, as long as you install it follow our steps, it will get fit. If you have any confuses about how to install it, you can contact with me directly, I will be happy to serve for you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qYcZAv0nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUJOY","source_asin":"B085M83V6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085M83V6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085M83V6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
