window.products.push({"id":198194,"name":"SANA Multi Speed Advanced Masticating Juicer | Patented DC Motor | Includes 2 Premium Accessories & Custom Recipe Book | Light Weight & Quiet Cold Pre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OB6hzU2qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PATENTED BRUSHLESS MOTOR - The SANA 727 was developed with an advanced brushless DC motor that allows for non stop operation and a unique auto-reverse feature. Additional benefits of our patented motor include a lightweight and durable design, longer operating time, lower power consumption, and ultra quiet operation. 4 SPEED MASTICATING JUICER - Offering four variable speed control options that range from 40, 65, 90 or 120 RPM. Lower speeds allow for gentle and precise juicing, minimizing foam and oxidation, especially good for soft or fibrous produce. Higher speeds are great for low fiber produce with a high liquid content like citrus. SANA SUPREME JUICING SYSTEM - Delivers the highest yield compared to other juicers, the heavy-duty auger grinds and presses your produce to squeeze out as much juice as possible from your produce making juicing faster. This advanced juicing system also offers many unique features including a locking juice flap and the first dual hopper feeding tube. MULTI USE 3 COLD PRESS JUICING SCREENS - Our electric cold press system offers three versatile screens. The fine juicing screen gives the highest juice yield. The coarse juicing screen has less pressure, allowing for softer fruits to be juiced and the homogenizing screen allows you to make all-natural nut butters and milks, along with sorbets, baby food, frozen dessert and more. MAX FLAVOR & NUTRIENTS - Assures higher nutritional content and freshest-tasting juices using masticating technology, extract rich and nutritious juices at home with the SANA 727. Ideal for juicing delicate herbs and all kinds of fibrous fruits and vegetables like watermelon, orange, celery, cucumber, apple, carrot, beets, ginger and more. PREMIUM SERVICE & ACCESSORIES - Along with our outstanding 15 Year Manufacturer Warranty we also ensure the full package is delivered in one box. Included with the SANA 727 Supreme juicer is a custom 132 page step-by-step recipe book, 1x Handmade 500ml Bohemian Crystal Glass and a custom-designed food-grade stainless steel upswept angled pulp catcher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OB6hzU2qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sana","source_asin":"B0BJYSG4Z7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJYSG4Z7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJYSG4Z7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
