window.products.push({"id":198285,"name":"Waring Commercial WCIC20 2 Quart Capacity Ice Cream Maker with Built in Compressor, 180W, 120V, 5-15 Phase Plug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":755.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gVT0M64QL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Make up to 2 quarts of ice cream, frozen yogurt or gelato in as little as 30 minutes with the Waring® WCIC20 Two-Quart Compressor Ice Cream Maker. The built-in compressor means no pre-freezing is required. The mixing paddle incorporates just the right amount of air so you get a perfect product every time. The removable aluminum batch bowl makes cleanup easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gVT0M64QL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waring Commercial","source_asin":"B0BS16YX5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS16YX5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS16YX5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":198286,"name":"L'AGRATY Fleece Throw Blankets Super Soft Flannel Cozy Blankets, Machine Washable Lightweight Fuzzy Blanket for Bed Office, Warm Plush Blankets for Al","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wwTIQ4JuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LINT-FREE DURABLE THROW BLANKET: Fleece blankets are made with 300 GSM of 100% premium microfiber polyester. Our soft blanket will be thicker and warmer than other blankets. The thicker design not only improves the softness of the blanket, also reduces the possibility of lint, and there is no need to worry about the problem of pilling. Tightly stitching edges and strong seams make your warm blanket more durable than cheap sew blankets. Who won't like comfortable, soft & warm blankets? PRACTICAL & DECORATIVE BLANKETS: Our Plush Blanket with Jacquard Geometry has a great balance in utility and decoration. You can use it as throw blankets for couch, bed, office while watching TV, or presents of lap blankets for elderly. The warm blanket is also a great choice for mothers to use as blankets for baby boys and girls. Besides, A soft pattern throw blanket that looks like herringbone on the surface is a graceful decorative accent for our room, adding liveness to your life. STANDARD SIZE&COLOR OPTIONS: Extra-large skin-friendly fabric plush flannel throw blanket wraps the body, relieving your mind and body. You can still keep breathable and warm without feeling heavy. If you have babies or cute pets like dogs and cats. also like this soft and warm blanket. Blankets full size available in grey, Brown,pink, green, Champagne and blue, choose which color you like. DIFFERENT COLORS UNDER LIGHT: We have fleece blankets in a variety of colors for you to choose from. The design available on both sides will make the color of the front and back a little different. The magic is that different ways of touching will also have color changes. At the same time, the colors displayed under different lights, display settings, or resolutions, will be slightly different. All of these will only increase his charm. MACHINE WASHABLE: Our fleece blanket is can be washable by machine. We recommend you cleaning lightweight blankets on a gentle cycle with cold water. This can make the blanket more durable. The connection at the seams of the fleece cloth has been improved, and the stronger structural strength makes our blankets not torn even after repeated washing, and there will be no fading, hair removal, pilling, etc. This is also due to our use of high-quality flannel fleece fabrics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wwTIQ4JuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L'AGRATY","source_asin":"B09YTSDKZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YTSDKZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YTSDKZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
