window.products.push({"id":198398,"name":"KAKABELL Pinch Pleat Goose Down Feathers Comforter Full/Queen Size All Season-Ultra Soft and Cozy Noiseless Duvet Insert with 100% Egyptian Cotton Cov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FlDamC4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅All Seasons Bed Comforter-The Pinch Pleat Full/Queen Size goose feather down comforter is 90x90 inches.and the grey premium feather down comforter provide year-round comfortable warmth.The moderate thickness makes it the perfect choice for seasons such as Spring,Summer,Autumn and Winter.The fluffy filling and high-grade fabrics give you a silky touch and all-night comfort.Simple but elegant pinch pleat design,fits various type of decoration,adding more beauty and coziness to your bedroom. ✅Premium Filling-The down and feather of our duvets are harvested in a non-living plucked humanitarian manner,The fillings of our comforter are Professional selection,cleaned.The down and feather we choose are no odor and fluffy.our all of filling material approved by RDS....Please use it with confidence. ✅Premium Material-The down comforter Cal king size is filled with 750+ Fill-Power 66 Oz premium goose feather down(75% feathers & 25% down)and the cover is made of 100% egyptian cotton with OEKO-Tex Standard 100 certification, so our hotel-style cozy comforter feels more soft, breathable and durable.the proper weight will give you a warm and comfortable sleep at night without too hot or cold. ✅Unique Design-In order to keep high softness and lock in temperature,Our duvets are baffle box technology for maximum loft and full use of the attic,allowing the filling to be evenly distributed throughout the duvet.8 corner loops to secure a duvet cover easily.Exquisite Hemming,Durable and Long Lasting.Can meet different needs,It could be used as a duvet insert as well as a stand-alone comforter,totally up to your choice. ✅Use Tips:This fluffy down comforter is vacuum packed.Recommend spread it for a few hours or tumble in the dryer for 20 minutes at low temperature at first time use.A duvet cover is recommended to maximize the lifespan of your feather down duvet.Dry cleaning with low heat when necessary.We are so confident in the quality of our product that we offer a 30 day return plan!if If you are not satisfied with the goose down feathers comforter or have any questions,please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FlDamC4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAKABELL","source_asin":"B09VS7SDFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VS7SDFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VS7SDFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":198399,"name":"Christmas Tree Iridescent Blue Tinsel Garland Metallic Streamers Unicorn and Winter Wonderland Party Happy New Year Ceiling Hanging Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jrxq0uFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Treasures Gifted: Make Celebrations Extraordinary! Balloons and fun are almost synonymous; you can't have one without the other! Making simple balloon decorations can make your party amazing! Whether you're a professional decorator or a mom that wants to throw a fun and budget-friendly birthday party for your kids, this is the best choice of balloons for you! THROWING A PARTY FOR THE FIRST TIME? Life gets crazy hectic when you know it. No need to sweat about the details of planning, we got you covered! We're sending you a FREE printable party planner kit with your purchase! Make party planning the most natural part of your day! A few tips to make your balloon stay inflated longer: 1. Balloons filled with air generally last longer than those filled with helium. On average, helium-filled balloons stay afloat between 6-8 hours, while air-filled ones stay inflated between 8-10 hours outdoors and 12-16 hours indoors. 2. Before the day of the event, test only one balloon to measure the heat, humidity, or rain in your environment. 3. Inflate balloons with less than the maximum amount of helium if you plan to use it outdoors. Over inflate it first and release some air after. This way, it doesn't pop when the helium inside expands due to higher temperatures. CAUTION: 1. The product contains rubber latex; please avoid contact in case of allergy. 2. Popped latex balloons are choking hazards to kids under eight years. Use it with supervision. 3. Guidance is also necessary for pets who may accidentally pop the balloons. WHAT YOU'LL GET: 1 Pcs 18 Feet Long Gorgeous Tinsel Garland and a FREE Printable Party Planning Kit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jrxq0uFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Treasures Gifted","source_asin":"B07YZTVQK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-198399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YZTVQK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YZTVQK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
